on changed fellow-passenger covering use substantially (80% vs 20%) while vehicles, ventilation, distancing advice, and service frequency were unchanged. Infection ascertainment was blinded and complete. The observed absolute reduction was 2 percentage points, and the interval excludes no effect.\n\n**4) Necessary conditions, if any:** Keep exemptions ordinary; no medical documentation or enforcement. Provide free coverings and accessible instructions by 15 June. Staff should only advise, not police fit or washing. Reassess at three weeks using uptake, complaints, access problems, and infection data; stop or adjust if burdens become unacceptable.\n\n**5) What evidence would change my decision:** A comparable evaluation showing no reduction or harm, especially with a 95% interval crossing or exceeding 1, or evidence that access burdens, delays, or confrontation are substantial enough to outweigh the infection benefit.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":0.98,"max_output_tokens":8000,"previous_response_id":null,"reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"status":"completed","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1198,"input_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":0,"cached_tokens_details":null,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null,"video_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":850,"output_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":492,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":2048,"cost":null},"user":null,"store":false,"access_programs":null,"background":false,"completed_at":1794660432,"content_filters":[{"blocked":false,"source_type":"prompt","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":7390,"check